<Trigger>
  <UserStory>
    <Title>Automated Loan Disbursement: Efficient Transfer of Approved Funds on Schedule</Title>
    <Description>
      As a bank loan officer, I want an automated loan disbursement system, so that the approved loan amounts can be transferred within standard disbursement timeframes.
    </Description>
    <AcceptanceCriteria>
      <Criterion>The system should automatically disburse the approved loan amount to the designated recipient (either the car dealer or the borrower) upon loan approval.</Criterion>
      <Criterion>The system should adhere to the standard disbursement timeframes set by the bank.</Criterion>
      <Criterion>The system should provide a confirmation notification to both the bank and the recipient once the disbursement is completed.</Criterion>
      <Criterion>The system should record all disbursement details, including recipient's name, loan amount, and disbursement date for auditing purposes.</Criterion>
      <Criterion>The system should handle any disbursement errors or failures gracefully and alert the bank loan officer immediately.</Criterion>
      <Criterion>The system should comply with all relevant financial regulations and bank's policies regarding loan disbursement.</Criterion>
    </AcceptanceCriteria>
  </UserStory>
</Trigger>